silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_01_thesis_concrete_anchor_2_B#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode2 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode2 is the source-schema object B of the Mittens vet-record category, concretely the time-point visit_1 of Mittens' first weekly check-up. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'B', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
